    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-touch-of-dissolution",
    "description": "<p>You collect corrosive chakra into your hand as you reach out and touch a surface you can reach, melting it entirely. When you cast this jutsu select one surface you can see as you begin to melt through it. If the surface selected is 1 foot or thinner, it is dissolved, leaving behind a 5-foot wide whole behind.</p>\n<p>If the surface is chakra enhanced, this jutsu will only work against it if it is no thicker than 6 inches</p>",
